Write "Hello from Engli." to the file "test.txt".

Read the file "test.txt" into contents.

Say contents.

If the file "test.txt" exists:

    Say "File exists.".

Otherwise:

    Say "File does not exist.".

Create the directory "data".

List the files in the directory "data" and store them in files.
